sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    actor User
    participant Folio
    participant Security as Spring Security
    participant AdminAPI as AdminController
    participant UserAPI as UserController
    participant Invite as InviteCodeService
    participant Users as UserService
    participant MySQL

    Admin->>Folio: create invite code
    Folio->>Security: POST /admin/invite-codes
    Security->>Security: require ADMIN
    Security->>AdminAPI: authenticated request
    AdminAPI->>Invite: createInviteCodes
    Invite->>Invite: validate count, expiry, uniqueness
    Invite->>MySQL: save enabled code + maxUses
    Invite-->>Folio: invite code
    User->>Folio: register username, password, invite code
    Folio->>UserAPI: POST /users/register
    UserAPI->>Users: registerUser
    Users->>Users: apply registration mode + password policy
    alt registration closed
        Users-->>Folio: 403 REGISTRATION_CLOSED
    else invite required
        Users->>Invite: consume code
        Invite->>MySQL: SELECT code FOR UPDATE
        Invite->>Invite: validate enabled, expiry, remaining uses
        Invite->>MySQL: increment usedCount
        Users->>MySQL: save BCrypt user with role USER
        Users-->>Folio: registration complete
    else open registration
        Users->>MySQL: save BCrypt user with role USER
        Users-->>Folio: registration complete
    end
    Note over Invite,MySQL: Invite consumption and user creation share the registration transaction<br/>a later failure rolls both back
